{% set date = date or "[DATE]" %}
{% set sender_name = sender_name or "[YOUR NAME]" %}
{% set sender_address = sender_address or "[YOUR ADDRESS]" %}
{% set sender_phone = sender_phone or "[YOUR PHONE]" %}
{% set sender_email = sender_email or "[YOUR EMAIL]" %}
{% set recipient_name = recipient_name or "[RECIPIENT NAME]" %}
{% set recipient_designation = recipient_designation or "[DESIGNATION]" %}
{% set recipient_address = recipient_address or "[RECIPIENT ADDRESS]" %}
{% set subject = subject or "[SUBJECT OF LETTER]" %}
{% set reference_number = reference_number or "" %}
{% set incident_date = incident_date or "[DATE OF INCIDENT]" %}
{% set incident_description = incident_description or "[DESCRIPTION OF INCIDENT]" %}
{% set legal_grounds = legal_grounds or "[LEGAL GROUNDS/SECTIONS]" %}
{% set demands = demands or "[YOUR DEMANDS/REQUESTS]" %}
{% set timeline = timeline or "15 days" %}
{% set consequences = consequences or "appropriate legal action" %}

{{ date }}

From:
{{ sender_name }}
{{ sender_address }}
Phone: {{ sender_phone }}
Email: {{ sender_email }}

To:
{{ recipient_name }}
{{ recipient_designation }}
{{ recipient_address }}

{% if reference_number %}
Reference: {{ reference_number }}
{% endif %}

Subject: {{ subject }}

Respected Sir/Madam,

I, {{ sender_name }}, am writing this letter to formally bring to your attention a matter of serious concern that requires immediate attention and appropriate action.

FACTS OF THE CASE:

On {{ incident_date }}, the following incident occurred:

{{ incident_description }}

LEGAL POSITION:

The above-mentioned actions/incidents are in violation of the following legal provisions:

{{ legal_grounds }}

These actions have caused me significant distress, harm, and violation of my fundamental rights as guaranteed under the Constitution of India.

DEMANDS AND RELIEF SOUGHT:

In light of the above facts and legal position, I hereby demand the following:

{{ demands }}

TIMELINE FOR COMPLIANCE:

I request you to take appropriate action and provide a written response to this letter within {{ timeline }} from the date of receipt of this communication.

CONSEQUENCES OF NON-COMPLIANCE:

Please note that if no satisfactory response or action is taken within the stipulated time period, I shall be constrained to initiate {{ consequences }} without any further notice, and all costs and consequences thereof shall be borne by you.

I trust that you will give this matter the urgent attention it deserves and take appropriate remedial measures at the earliest.

Thanking you,

Yours faithfully,

{{ sender_name }}

---
ATTACHMENTS (if any):
{% if attachments %}
{% for attachment in attachments %}
{{ loop.index }}. {{ attachment }}
{% endfor %}
{% else %}
[LIST ANY SUPPORTING DOCUMENTS ATTACHED]
{% endif %}

---
DECLARATION:
I, {{ sender_name }}, hereby declare that the contents of this letter are true and correct to the best of my knowledge and belief.

Date: {{ date }}
Place: {{ sender_address.split(',')[0] if ',' in sender_address else "[PLACE]" }}

Signature: _________________
Name: {{ sender_name }}
